    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88357" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόπομα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drink taken before meals,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phylarch.
				50J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.734a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.828
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκράτισμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.624c
			</span></i>.—A form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόπωμα</span></b>  is cited by Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.935
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Choerob.
				<u>in Theod.</u>
				1.339
			</span></i>; cf.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπουματᾶς.</span></div>
